description:
Design a pulse generator that produces a single high pulse on the output for one clock cycle every 16 clock cycles. It utilizes a 5-bit counter to count the clock cycles; when the counter reaches 16 (binary 10000), it resets the counter and sets the pulse output high, effectively generating a periodic pulse. The output pulse returns to low in subsequent cycles until the next pulse is triggered.
