description:
Design a 2-to-4 decoder that takes a 2-bit input (SEL) and activates one of four output lines (OUT), each corresponding to a single bit of the output. When SEL is 00, the first output line is high; when SEL is 01, the second output line is high; when SEL is 10, the third output line is high; and when SEL is 11, the fourth output line is high, with all other output lines low.
module top_module(
    input [1:0] SEL,
    output reg [15:0] OUT
);

code:
module top_module(
    input [1:0] SEL,
    output reg [15:0] OUT
);always @(*) begin
        case(SEL)
            2'b00: OUT = 16'b0000000000000001;
            2'b01: OUT = 16'b0000000000000010;
            2'b10: OUT = 16'b0000000000000100;
            2'b11: OUT = 16'b0000000000001000;
        endcase
    end

endmodule

