description:
Design a digital majority gate that produces a HIGH output when at least three out of four input signals (A, B, C, D) are HIGH. The module calculates various pairwise AND combinations of the inputs and uses an OR operation to determine if any combination of three or more inputs is asserted, resulting in the output Y being HIGH.
module top_module(
    input A, B, C, D,
    output Y
);

code:
module top_module(
    input A, B, C, D,
    output Y
);wire AB, AC, AD, BC, BD, CD;

assign AB = A & B;
assign AC = A & C;
assign AD = A & D;
assign BC = B & C;
assign BD = B & D;
assign CD = C & D;

assign Y = (AB | AC | AD | BC | BD | CD);

endmodule

